# Now-playing tile (bottom-right corner). It reads your Spotify listening from your
# Discord status through Lanyard. No API key is needed.
#
# Setup:
#   1. Join the Lanyard Discord server: https://discord.gg/UrXF2cfJ7F
#      (this is what makes Lanyard start tracking you)
#   2. In Discord: Settings > Connections > Spotify, connect your account and turn on
#      "Display Spotify as your status".
#   3. Discord: Settings > Advanced > turn on Developer Mode, then right-click your own
#      name anywhere and choose "Copy User ID".
#   4. Copy this file to .env.local, paste the ID below, restart `npm run dev`.
#      On Vercel, add the same variable under Project Settings > Environment Variables.
#
# Until it is set, the tile shows "Nothing to show right now"; no errors.
# (The album and artist pictures on /interests do not need any of this.)

DISCORD_USER_ID=
